#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:95
#: 2330d23e7d264be18433b4c2b6789893
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:97
#: f6c9a8bb5ba34462ae3208ec718dda81
msgid "RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:99
#: f09ad9035b1a44cba0d6345ce7d63624
msgid "FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:101
#: 1bb1f3289f01487ebaae7c8c94c7991d
msgid "CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:103
#: 93eef6e0e44045c3af6cb23023197e86
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:105
#: 78c111332ff74188aca099c0f0c51f1c
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:108
#: eca8fa21efe5438aae7bc16098b0e783
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:110
#: 479e487e11364a65a62557544e220ce2
msgid "The autopilot  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 (setup by default)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:113
#: 2d9364a357794672a764e7c883bdfb11
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:115
#: 02be154e4ed8489daf0e4f8b3fcfa15a
msgid "The  BLITZ F745 supports up to 9 PWM outputs (PWM 9 defaults to serial LED output). Outputs 1-4 are available via a JST-SH connector, others via solder pads. All outputs support DShot, as well as all PWM types. The first 4 outputs support bi-directional DShot also."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:117
#: 7f04cec883a54cec8b5ad726d3b83426
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:119
#: f102bb03e55e45a1b2389b2d9bbd5eb3
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:120
#: 20aa849a241c4b44be1f375fcfcbd138
msgid "PWM 5-8 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:121
#: 3f6bdd324ab24d63a193920960d15c8f
msgid "PWM 9 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:123
#: bee92738c7a84f629433cb95c116db2c
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:127
#: 8be6e33900b7410b9c82d720022b183b
msgid "for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:129
#: 67811bb872764d108fbaed5f7d9ec2a9
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:130
#: d2a23004d0c7408bae33897d450f949d
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:133
#: 90cc38e70edd4d9584192bbfbd83d784
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:135
#: 7fd890ceaa454a00ba35ff2d95c00edc
msgid "The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:138
#: 40669608a01a4d7fb8ac0e6c3d5237bb
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:140
#: dbfece67a5604f5b9d1c5ce3546c0111
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 ESC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitz-f745.rst:142
#: 1e26891713b142e4a2320f666d1c41c3
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr ""

